# Quick controls at 320x480 (profile p320, the narrow portrait panel): the page header holds the Esc and the strip only
# (no title); the buttons are 2 x 2 or one column of four, whichever the room allows. Review only: no golden.
title p320 quick controls
review
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_QUICKCTL_ADAPTERS all
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI "Quick controls" SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch "Quick controls"
wait 600
shot p320_qc_open
expect_text Shutdown
key ENTER
wait 400
shot p320_qc_wifi_off
expect_radio wifi off
expect_power none
